{
  "name": "ListRelatedInvoiceExports",
  "method": "POST",
  "path": "/message/ListRelatedInvoiceExports",
  "description": "Lists the invoice exports related to the given invoice. Relations are resolved through the orders the invoice was billed against, including their returns and the orders they return, so corrections, cancellations, replacements and return invoices are all returned. The exports of the given invoice itself are excluded. Rows carry the same fields as \u0060ListInvoiceExports2\u0060, plus a \u0060RelationType\u0060.",
